","content":"LLM outputs are non-deterministic. Running the same benchmark twice may produce slightly different scores.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":608.94,"x":55.38,"y":2250.6},{"type":"text","id":"tar","name":"Scores reflect the current review pipeli","content":"Scores reflect the current review pipeline. Improvements to prompting, chunking, and context retrieval will change results.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":608.94,"x":55.38,"y":2303.38},{"type":"text","id":"tas","name":"The benchmark evaluates the review pipel","content":"The benchmark evaluates the review pipeline end-to-end, not the raw model capability. nitpickr's prompt construction and output parsing contribute to the final quality.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":608.94,"x":55.38,"y":2356.16},{"type":"text","id":"tat","name":"Contributing to the benchmark","content":"Contributing to the benchmark","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":36.19,"y":2466.66},{"type":"text","id":"tau","name":"If you have pull requests with well-defi","content":"If you have pull requests with well-defined expected findings, contributions to the test","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":36.19,"y":2521.57},{"type":"text","id":"tav","name":"corpus are welcome. See the","content":"corpus are wel