itpickr pricing compare to Cod","content":"How does nitpickr pricing compare to CodeRabbit?","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":36.19,"y":2306.43},{"type":"text","id":"tkj","name":"nitpickr has no per-seat or subscription","content":"nitpickr has no per-seat or subscription fees. You pay only for your own LLM API usage and hosting costs. Running locally with Docker Compose and a free HTTPS tunnel means you mainly pay for model usage. CodeRabbit charges per-seat subscription fees on top of any underlying model costs.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":628.13,"x":36.19,"y":2333.82},{"type":"text","id":"tkk","name":"Does nitpickr support GitHub, GitLab, an","content":"Does nitpickr support GitHub, GitLab, and Bitbucket?","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":36.19,"y":2468.04},{"type":"text","id":"tkl","name":"nitpickr currently supports GitHub throu","content":"nitpickr currently supports GitHub through a GitHub App integration. GitLab and Bitbucket support are on the roadmap. The internal architecture is already provider-agnostic to support future expansion.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":628.13,"x":36.19,"y":2495.43}]}]}]},{"type":"ref","id":"rl5","ref":"f3c","name":"footer / desktop","x":0,"y":3282.5}]}]}],"x":6180,"y":0},{"type":"frame","id":"Ppy","name":"GH-39/A/compare-coderabbit/mobile/light","reusable":false,"theme":{"mode":"light"},"width":390,"height":4663,"clip":true,"layout":"no